{
 "riverhold-wren": {
  "Oh! You startled me. Sorry. I'm Wren.": "riverhold-wren-01",
  "I've been sitting by this gate three days now, watching who comes and goes.": "riverhold-wren-02",
  "There's work waiting for me in Stonebridge, a few days down the river road. Honest work. Mostly.": "riverhold-wren-03",
  "But the road's crawling with bandits since the bridge washed out, and the wolves are bold enough to take a drover's cattle.": "riverhold-wren-04",
  "One elf with a dagger doesn't get far out there alone. I've tried. Twice.": "riverhold-wren-05",
  "Two of us, though? That's a different story. I'm quick, I'm quiet, and there's no lock in the Riverlands I can't open.": "riverhold-wren-06",
  "So... are you heading that way? Will you let me come with you?": "riverhold-wren-07",
  "Really? Ha! You won't regret it, I promise.": "riverhold-wren-08",
  "Let me fetch my pack. When you set out for Stonebridge, I'll be right behind you.": "riverhold-wren-09",
  "Ah. Well, I can't blame you. The road's dangerous enough without strangers.": "riverhold-wren-10",
  "If you change your mind, I'll be here by the gate. Probably.": "riverhold-wren-11"
 }
}
